Subject: [PATCH 12/51] Switch port README, LEIA-ME and build scripts; drop
 upstream PC CI.

- README.md describes the Switch port (upstream README moved to docs/).
- nx/LEIA-ME.txt (package notes), nx/shadervariants.txt (fresh installs).
- nx/build: build-switch.sh (devkitPro install), package.sh, build-libsndfile.sh
  and toolchain-from-source/ (devkitA64 + libnx + portlibs from GitHub).
- The upstream workflows build and publish PC releases; they don't apply here.

